# Normalize all text to LF in the repository.
#
# Without this, `core.autocrlf=true` on Windows stores CRLF-converted content
# and every tool that writes LF (Prettier, editors, scripts) produces spurious
# whole-file diffs. Setting it before the first content commit costs nothing;
# adding it later rewrites every file at once.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary formats - never touch these.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
*.mgpt binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
